以更換成粗麵，也能調整麵條硬度，還提供免費加湯、加麵，對食量大的人來說很加分 😆\n\n除了拉麵本身，最讓我印象深刻的是店員親切又熱情的招呼，一進門就能感受到滿滿的活力，讓人有種回到家的溫暖感覺。整體用餐體驗很不錯，會讓人想再訪☺️",null,[0,68]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/13779380624614280929/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjEzZEZOWE5VdFBWWFJ0VVZoV1dGTkZVbXBOVkZadFlURmFVMWd4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13779380624614280929/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjEzZEZOWE5VdFBWWFJ0VVZoV1dGTkZVbXBOVkZadFlURmFVMWd4UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/13779380624614280929/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjEzZEZOWE5VdFBWWFJ0VVZoV1dGTkZVbXBOVkZadFlURmFVMWd4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13779380624614280929/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjEzZEZOWE5VdFBWWFJ0VVZoV1dGTkZVbXBOVkZadFlURmFVMWd4UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/13779380624614280929/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjEzZEZOWE5VdFBWWFJ0VVZoV1dGTkZVbXBOVkZadFlURmFVMWd4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13779380624614280929/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjEzZEZOWE5VdFBWWFJ0VVZoV1dGTkZVbXBOVkZadFlURmFVMWd4UlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,13944,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT213dFNXNUtPVXRtUVhWWFNFUmpNVFZtYTFaU1gxRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xc3fb93a50128e06b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmwtSW5KOUtmQXVXSERjMTVma1ZSX1E%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT213dFNXNUtPVXRtUVhWWFNFUmpNVFZtYTFaU1gxRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT213dFNXNUtPVXRtUVhWWFNFUmpNVFZtYTFaU1gxRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT213dFNXNUtPVXRtUVhWWFNFUmpNVFZtYTFaU1gxRRILMGRHVUtLcFRWaXUaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09td3RTVzVLT1V0bVFYVlhTRVJqTVRWbWExWlNYMUUSCzBkR1VLS3BUVml1IhIJAAAAAAAAAAARa-AoAaWT-8